{"id":"vd-b1-the-escape-room","level":"b1","n":9,"title":{"en":"Let's Split Up!","vi":"Chia nhau ra nào!"},"summary":"Còn bốn mươi lăm phút trong phòng thoát hiểm; Nora thôi ra lệnh và bắt đầu phân công, còn Ben thì phát hiện manh mối đầu tiên.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-escape-room","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Escape Room","vi":"Phòng thoát hiểm"}},"scene":{"background":"library","props":[]},"cast":{"nora":{"name":{"en":"Nora","vi":"Nora"},"look":"woman","x":540,"style":{"hair":"bob","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","outfit":"suit","top":"#6C3483","topShade":"#5B2C6F"}},"ben":{"name":{"en":"Ben","vi":"Ben"},"look":"man","x":1140,"style":{"hair":"fringe","hairColor":"#D9B26F","outfit":"shirt","top":"#E67E22","topShade":"#CA6F1E"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"nora","en":"Stop, everyone! We've wasted fifteen minutes. This isn't working.","vi":"Dừng lại, mọi người! Chúng ta đã phí mười lăm phút rồi. Thế này không ổn.","ipa":["stɑp","ˈɛvɹiˌwʌn","wiv","ˈweɪstɪd","fɪfˈtin","ˈmɪnəts","ðɪs","ˈɪzənt","ˈwɝkɪŋ"],"start":0.554,"end":6.114,"expression":"angry","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.119],[2,2.535],[3,2.812],[4,3.269],[5,3.701],[6,5.06],[7,5.36],[8,5.636]]},{"speaker":"ben","en":"Well, what do you suggest, boss?","vi":"Vậy sếp đề xuất gì nào?","ipa":["wɛl","wʌt","du","ju","səˈdʒɛst","bɑs"],"start":6.904,"end":8.994,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,6.904],[1,7.361],[2,7.517],[3,7.601],[4,7.71],[5,8.503]]},{"speaker":"nora","en":"Let's split up. You take the shelves, and I'll take the door.","vi":"Chia nhau ra đi. Anh lo mấy cái kệ, còn tôi lo cánh cửa.","ipa":["lɛts","splɪt","ʌp","ju","teɪk","ðə","ʃɛlvz","ənd","aɪl","teɪk","ðə","dɔɹ"],"start":9.784,"end":13.634,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,9.784],[1,10.059],[2,10.323],[3,11.499],[4,11.679],[5,11.932],[6,12.028],[7,12.653],[8,12.809],[9,12.941],[10,13.17],[11,13.266]]},{"speaker":"ben","en":"What about Raj and Kit?","vi":"Còn Raj và Kit thì sao?","ipa":["wʌt","əˈbaʊt","ɹɑʒ","ənd","kɪt"],"start":14.424,"end":15.634,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,14.424],[1,14.534],[2,14.823],[3,15.171],[4,15.304]]},{"speaker":"nora","en":"Raj can check the desk. And Kit wants to look at the map.","vi":"Raj kiểm tra cái bàn. Còn Kit muốn xem tấm bản đồ.","ipa":["ɹɑʒ","kæn","tʃɛk","ðə","dɛsk","ənd","kɪt","wɑnts","tu","lʊk","æt","ðə","mæp"],"start":16.424,"end":20.284,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,16.424],[1,16.819],[2,16.999],[3,17.252],[4,17.372],[5,18.68],[6,18.896],[7,19.161],[8,19.437],[9,19.545],[10,19.762],[11,19.846],[12,19.93]]},{"speaker":"ben","en":"OK. What am I looking for?","vi":"Được. Tôi đang tìm cái gì vậy?","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","wʌt","æm","aɪ","ˈlʊkɪŋ","fɔɹ"],"start":21.074,"end":23.444,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,21.074],[1,22.394],[2,22.599],[3,22.695],[4,22.779],[5,23.091]]},{"speaker":"nora","en":"Anything strange. Let me know if you find anything.","vi":"Bất cứ thứ gì lạ. Có gì thì báo tôi nhé.","ipa":["ˈɛniˌθɪŋ","stɹeɪndʒ","lɛt","mi","noʊ","ɪf","ju","faɪnd","ˈɛniˌθɪŋ"],"start":24.234,"end":27.744,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,24.234],[1,24.667],[2,26.143],[3,26.42],[4,26.54],[5,26.744],[6,26.852],[7,26.961],[8,27.249]]},{"speaker":"ben","en":"Wait! There's something inside this bottle. It's a small key!","vi":"Khoan! Có gì đó trong cái chai này. Một chiếc chìa khoá nhỏ!","ipa":["weɪt","ðɛɹz","ˈsʌmθɪŋ","ˌɪnˈsaɪd","ðɪs","ˈbɑtəl","ɪts","ə","smɔl","ki"],"start":28.534,"end":33.404,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,28.534],[1,29.806],[2,30.071],[3,30.455],[4,30.9],[5,31.068],[6,32.354],[7,32.559],[8,32.631],[9,33.015]]},{"speaker":"nora","en":"Good thinking, Ben! Can you check if it opens the desk drawer?","vi":"Khá lắm, Ben! Anh thử xem nó có mở được ngăn kéo bàn không?","ipa":["ɡʊd","ˈθɪŋkɪŋ","bɛn","kæn","ju","tʃɛk","ɪf","ɪt","ˈoʊpənz","ðə","dɛsk","dɹɔɹ"],"start":34.194,"end":38.224,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,34.194],[1,34.396],[2,34.961],[3,36.197],[4,36.426],[5,36.546],[6,36.858],[7,36.979],[8,37.099],[9,37.483],[10,37.592],[11,37.88]]},{"speaker":"ben","en":"Yes! It opens. There's a sheet of paper with lots of numbers.","vi":"Có! Mở được rồi. Có một tờ giấy đầy những con số.","ipa":["jɛs","ɪt","ˈoʊpənz","ðɛɹz","ə","ʃit","ʌv","ˈpeɪpɚ","wɪð","lɑts","ʌv","ˈnʌmbɚz"],"start":39.014,"end":44.254,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","timing":[[0,39.014],[1,40.334],[2,40.527],[3,41.993],[4,42.221],[5,42.294],[6,42.594],[7,42.714],[8,43.099],[9,43.231],[10,43.58],[11,43.676]]},{"speaker":"nora","en":"Give it to Raj. He's the numbers person.","vi":"Đưa cho Raj đi. Anh ấy là người của những con số mà.","ipa":["ɡɪv","ɪt","tu","ɹɑʒ","hiz","ðə","ˈnʌmbɚz","ˈpɝsən"],"start":45.044,"end":48.104,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,45.044],[1,45.22],[2,45.329],[3,45.449],[4,46.805],[5,47.082],[6,47.178],[7,47.562]]},{"speaker":"ben","en":"Raj says it's a code. Every number is a letter.","vi":"Raj bảo đó là mật mã. Mỗi con số là một chữ cái.","ipa":["ɹɑʒ","sɛz","ɪts","ə","koʊd","ˈɛvɚi","ˈnʌmbɚ","ɪz","ə","ˈlɛtɚ"],"start":48.894,"end":52.304,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,48.894],[1,49.231],[2,49.531],[3,49.675],[4,49.76],[5,51.056],[6,51.356],[7,51.729],[8,51.873],[9,51.945]]},{"speaker":"nora","en":"Brilliant. How long do we have?","vi":"Tuyệt vời. Chúng ta còn bao lâu?","ipa":["ˈbɹɪljənt","haʊ","lɔŋ","du","wi","hæv"],"start":53.094,"end":55.424,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,53.094],[1,54.484],[2,54.677],[3,54.929],[4,55.013],[5,55.121]]},{"speaker":"ben","en":"Twenty minutes. We're running out of time!","vi":"Hai mươi phút. Sắp hết giờ rồi!","ipa":["ˈtwɛnti","ˈmɪnəts","wiɹ","ˈɹʌnɪŋ","aʊt","ʌv","taɪm"],"start":56.214,"end":59.194,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,56.214],[1,56.513],[2,57.893],[3,58.157],[4,58.482],[5,58.614],[6,58.722]]},{"speaker":"nora","en":"Don't panic. We're a team now. Kit, is there anything on the map?","vi":"Đừng hoảng. Giờ chúng ta là một đội. Kit, trên bản đồ có gì không?","ipa":["doʊnt","ˈpænɪk","wiɹ","ə","tim","naʊ","kɪt","ɪz","ðɛɹ","ˈɛniˌθɪŋ","ɑn","ðə","mæp"],"start":59.984,"end":65.184,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,59.984],[1,60.235],[2,61.591],[3,61.903],[4,61.975],[5,62.252],[6,63.442],[7,63.959],[8,64.079],[9,64.259],[10,64.632],[11,64.752],[12,64.824]]},{"speaker":"ben","en":"She's found a town with four tiny numbers next to it!","vi":"Cô ấy tìm được một thị trấn có bốn con số tí hon bên cạnh!","ipa":["ʃiz","faʊnd","ə","taʊn","wɪð","fɔɹ","ˈtaɪni","ˈnʌmbɚz","nɛkst","tu","ɪt"],"start":65.974,"end":68.684,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,65.974],[1,66.205],[2,66.457],[3,66.517],[4,66.878],[5,67.022],[6,67.334],[7,67.671],[8,68.08],[9,68.368],[10,68.5]]},{"speaker":"nora","en":"That's the code for the padlock. Quick, read them to me!","vi":"Đó là mã của ổ khoá. Nhanh lên, đọc cho tôi đi!","ipa":["ðæts","ðə","koʊd","fɔɹ","ðə","ˈpædˌlɑk","kwɪk","rid","ðɛm","tu","mi"],"start":69.474,"end":73.154,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,69.474],[1,69.763],[2,69.871],[3,70.171],[4,70.267],[5,70.352],[6,71.84],[7,72.381],[8,72.585],[9,72.73],[10,72.838]]},{"speaker":"ben","en":"I can't believe it. This is actually good teamwork. Mr. Slate will be so pleased.","vi":"Không thể tin nổi. Đây mới thật sự là tinh thần đồng đội. Ông Slate sẽ vui lắm đây.","ipa":["aɪ","kænt","bɪˈliv","ɪt","ðɪs","ɪz","ˈækˌtʃuəli","ɡʊd","ˈtimˌwɝk","ˈmɪstɚ","sleɪt","wɪl","bi","soʊ","plizd"],"start":73.944,"end":80.094,"expression":"happy","react":{"nora":"happy"},"timing":[[0,73.944],[1,74.03],[2,74.331],[3,74.655],[4,75.711],[5,75.976],[6,76.144],[7,76.564],[8,76.793],[9,78.235],[10,78.608],[11,78.956],[12,79.076],[13,79.221],[14,79.497]]}],"words":[{"id":"split","en":"split","ipa":"splɪt","vi":"chia, tách; nứt ra; sự chia rẽ","level":1},{"id":"code","en":"code","ipa":"koʊd","vi":"mã; mã lệnh; bộ luật","level":0},{"id":"teamwork","en":"teamwork","ipa":"ˈtimˌwɝk","vi":"làm việc nhóm; tinh thần đồng đội","level":2},{"id":"waste","en":"waste","ipa":"weɪst","vi":"lãng phí; rác thải; sự phí phạm","level":2},{"id":"drawer","en":"drawer","ipa":"dɹɔɹ","vi":"ngăn kéo","level":1},{"id":"pleased","en":"pleased","ipa":"plizd","vi":"hài lòng; vui lòng","level":1}],"focus":{"title":"Phân công và phối hợp theo nhóm","pattern":"Let's split up. · You take…, I'll… · Can you check…? · Let me know if you find anything. · Good thinking! · We're running out of time!","explain":"Chia việc: \"Let's split up.\", \"You take the shelves; I'll take the desk.\" (will cho quyết định tức thì). Nhờ kiểm tra: \"Can you check…?\". Giữ liên lạc: \"Let me know if you find anything.\" Khen nhanh: \"Good thinking!\". Báo gấp: \"We're running out of time!\"","keys":["let's split up","you take","i'll","can you check","let me know if","good thinking","running out of time"],"lines":[2,6,8,13]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b1-the-escape-room.mp3","v":"b514a56dad","duration":81.192,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}